# Pairs with RevocationTakesEffect. Waiting out a lease that has not really
# lapsed on the peer lets the write return while the peer still trusts it.
MODULE: LapseKeepsTrust
TARGET: RevocationTakesEffect
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the publication stops waiting for the peer while the peer still trusts its lease
PERTURBS: Lapse

--- FIND
    /\ trusted' = FALSE
    /\ captured' = FALSE
--- REPLACE
    /\ trusted' = trusted
    /\ captured' = FALSE
--- END